NetBond
=======

NetBond's multi-connection download engine (block planning, work scheduling,
hedged requests, splits and adaptive per-network concurrency, in the
com.netmax.netbond.engine package) is a Kotlin port of the pure,
I/O-free logic from Plexo:

    Plexo - https://github.com/anmolkapil/plexo
    Copyright (c) 2026 Anmol Kapil
    License: MIT

Plexo's desktop-only parts (Electron UI, OS socket binding, torrent/NZB
support, browser extension) are not included. NetBond re-implements network
binding for Android (android.net.Network per-socket binding) and adds its own
UI, service layer and storage.
